hat nobody else does and that's what  that's the crazy thing about superman is  he kind of looks at this and says like  sure  koslov is using like cheap labor and and  he is essentially taking advantage of  people he could pay them more but he  chooses not to because  you know he pays them the least he can  possibly get away with but that's the  world as it exists right now right  that's just the nature of of capitalism  right the greatest financial reward for  the least amount of work  it's the way capitalism functions that's  what you and i strive for right we all  strive  for the greatest reward for the least  amount of work so again it's just kind  of the nature of the world that we live  in and it really kind of lives up to the  charter in the philosophy of superman  which is  leading the world into a better place  and so he if he's going to arbitrarily  destroy  koslov for doing what essentially every  capitalist  businessman and on a more micro level  everything that every average normal  person does  then he would basically end up  destroying the world he'd kill pretty  much everybody across the world  because everybody engages in that  practice in some form or fashion over  the course of their life and so  ultimately he's just kind of like does  anybody out there care  if anybody did care the world wouldn't  be this screwed up right people would do  something about it and so i care and so  i'm going to do something right like i  always care no matter what the  consequences are  i will always care this is a  ridiculously great  story right it's just an amazing  superman story and dc needs more stories  like this so with that being said guys  we're gonna bring this video to an end  if you are new here to comics explained  make sure you guys hit the sub button  become part of the rob core if you guys  enjoyed this video  make sure you drop a like and i will  catch you all later  peace  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  you
 

